# Owner: control registryconfig. String canonical absolute protected JSON path;
# optional component has no default: omit this key and YAML selector to disable.
# When present the path is required/nonempty; no URL, inline secret or relative
# reference. Maps control.yaml image_registry_config_file. Explicit serve
# --env-file wins over a valid YAML selector; process environment is ignored.
# JSON owns all typed component fields in control.schema.json; secret values stay
# in protected referenced files. Restart required, no rebuild. For Compose put
# this file beneath the base private config mount; for Helm declare it and JSON/
# CA/credential/trust basenames in secrets.files plus policyEnvironmentFile.
# For Helm select the actual privateMountPath/private/registry-control.json path;
# Compose uses the base private mount directly. No path is silently rewritten.
PROJECT_ONE_REGISTRY_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/registry-control.json
